nd uncollected dispatches. There is no Tally post, no bank feed, and no GST filing.`:t.includes(`attend`)||t.includes(`geofence`)?`Attendance check-in always reports inside the Riverside Demo Plant fence. Distance is a random number of metres. The browser is not asked for location.`:`This demo does not call an AI model. Sample answer: the seeded plant desk looks routine. Open the matching module for the underlying tickets rather than treating this box as a live advisor.`}function ss(){let[e,t]=(0,p.useState)(``),[n,r]=(0,p.useState)(null),i=(0,p.useMemo)(()=>n?os(n):null,[n]);return(0,m.jsxs)(V,{title:`Chat`,subtitle:`Stubbed Q&A. No model, no Gemini.`,backTo:`/home`,children:[(0,m.jsx)(Na,{children:`Answers are canned copy for the sales tour. Nothing here is live plant telemetry.`}),(0,m.jsx)(R,{children:(0,m.jsxs)(`form`,{onSubmit:t=>{t.preventDefault();let n=e.trim();n&&r(n)},style:{display:`grid`,gap:10},children:[(0,m.jsx)(B,{value:e,onChange:e=>t(e.target.value),placeholder:`Ask about the sample plant…`}),(0,m.jsx)(po,{type:`submit`,block:!0,children:`Ask (sample answer)`})]})}),(0,m.jsx)(`div`,{style:{display:`flex`,flexWrap:`wrap`,gap:8,marginTop:12},children:as.map(e=>(0,m.jsx)(`button`,{type:`button`,onClick:()=>{t(e),r(e)},style:{border:`1px solid ${P.line}`,background:P.paper,borderRadius:999,padding:`8px 12px`,fontSize:13,cursor:`pointer`,color:P.forest},children:e},e))}),i?(0,m.jsxs)(R,{style:{marginTop:16},children:[(0,m.jsx)(`div`,{style:{fontSize:12,color:P.muted,fontWeight:700,marginBottom:8},children:`SAMPLE ANSWER`}),(0,m.jsx)(`div`,{style:{fontSize:15,lineHeight:1.5},children:i})]}):null]})}var cs=[{icon:`⚖`,title:`Weighbridge Management`,body:`Log vehicle entries, auto-calculate moisture deductions, track inbound raw materials and outbound dispatches with full traceability.`},{icon:`🏭`,title:`Production Tracking`,body:`Shift-based logging with per-machine breakdowns. Know exactly how much each machine produced, downtime reasons, and capacity utilization.`},{icon:`🔬`,title:`Quality Testing`,body:`Record GCV, moisture, ash content, and bulk density for every batch. Auto-flag non-compliant batches against NTPC specs.`},{icon:`🚚`,title:`Dispatch & Invoicing`,body:`Generate dispatch orders, track delivery status, and create GST-compliant invoices — all from the same screen.`},{icon:`📊`,title:`Real-Time Analytics`,body:`KPI dashboards showing capacity utilization, quality benchmarks, revenue trends, and 30-day production vs dispatch analysis.`},{icon:`📱`,title:`Mobile Worker App`,body:`Field-optimized interface with OTP login, large touch targets, and offline support. Workers see only what they need.`}],ls=[{icon:`👑`,title:`Owner`,body:`Full plant visibility. Financials, production, quality — one dashboard.`},{icon:`📋`,title:`Manager`,body:`Team admin, production oversight, dispatch approvals, supplier management.`},{icon:`💰`,title:`Accountant`,body:`Invoicing, procurement, expense tracking, GST reports, payment status.`},{icon:`👷`,title:`Worker`,body:`Mobile-only. Weighbridge entries, production logs, quality readings.`}],us=[{href:`https://www.kanoz.in/tools/coal-to-pellet.html`,icon:`🔥`,title:`Coal to Pellet Converter`,body:`Calculate how much biomass pellet you need to replace your current coal usage.`},{href:`https://www.kanoz.in/tools/freight-calculator.html`,icon:`🚚`,title:`Freight Calculator`,body:`Estimate transport costs for pellet deliveries based on distance and tonnage.`},{href:`https://www.kanoz.in/#calculator`,icon:`💰`,title:`Savings Calculator`,body:`See how much your factory can save annually by switching from coal to biomass pellets.`}];function ds(){return(0,m.jsxs)(`div`,{className:`po-landing`,children:[(0,m.jsx)(`header`,{className:`po-header`,children:(0,m.jsxs)(`div`,{className:`po-header-inner`,children:[(0,m.jsxs)(`a`,{href:`#top`,className:`po-logo`,children:[(0,m.jsx)(`img`,{src:`/logo.png`,alt:`PelletOps`,width:28,height:28}),(0,m.jsx)(`span`,{children:`PelletOps`})]}),(0,m.jsxs)(`n